subckt dut (VDD VSS CKB1 CKB2 CK1 CK2 Voutn Voutp)
C1 (net0 VSS) capacitor c=1p
C2 (net1 VSS) capacitor c=1p
M1 (Voutp CKB2 VDD VDD) sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=150n ng=1 m=1
M2 (Voutn CKB1 VDD VDD) sg13_lv_pmos w=1u l=150n ng=1 m=1
M3 (Voutp Voutn net1 VSS) sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=150n ng=1 m=1
M4 (Voutn Voutp net0 VSS) sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=150n ng=1 m=1
M5 (net0 CK1 VSS VSS) sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=150n ng=1 m=1
M6 (net1 CK2 VSS VSS) sg13_lv_nmos w=1u l=150n ng=1 m=1
